# FunFriday 🐺

FunFriday is an open-source, real-time social deduction party game. 

## License
This project is licensed under the **GNU AGPLv3**. 
You are free to host your own version of this game for personal use. However, if you modify and host this software publicly over a network, you MUST provide the complete source code of your modified version to your users under the same AGPLv3 license.

## Contributing
We welcome community contributions! To submit code, you must sign our Contributor License Agreement (CLA). This ensures the core team retains the right to dual-license the project for future commercial distribution, keeping the project financially sustainable.